{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_07_beg","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_07","title":"“屏风卫”","storyCode":"WB-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cc0491014c7301679e1d7f2c441dc12f8ef300e4b694d21f2157dac0af88409c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"杜遥夜和林雨霞拼死保下了真实的天灾数据，也幸运地得到了槐琥仇白等人的帮助。面对危险的敌人，一众江湖后生联手抗敌。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"一个，两个，三个。\n挥锤。\n七千多个日夜，他都如此般挥锤。\n他多么希望锤头不是落在未成形的铁坯，而是仇人的刀刃上，头颅上。\n就像，现在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们退下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......锤很沉，但不够快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很沉就够了，很沉就能砸断你的刀，再砸烂你的脑袋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，我原本为你们设计了更好的死法。我本应该在这间仓库里埋满炸药，天灾来的时候，用你们山海众的命为玉门祭旗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，包括我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这才是你的计划？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然，我为什么要主动找你们合作？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们似乎，没有这么大的仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初你们是如何混进玉门，如何乔装成武人骗取守军信任，如何到处作乱，玉门又是如何变成今天的样子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记性，未免太差！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这帮宵小出现在城里的第一天，我就认出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是等了你们，二十年！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊可惜，一点意外，满盘皆输......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但幸好，我还有这把锤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仓库里光线昏暗，林雨霞手上的玻璃剑刃反而越发透明。\n山海众似乎对她精妙的源石技艺有些忌惮，没有一拥而上，而是彼此配合，慢慢缩小着包围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这样一伙人，居然能在城市里神出鬼没这么久不被发现......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不是民间的武术流派，也不是哪国的军方格斗术，但狠辣凌厉，而且远近分工，配合默契......究竟是什么来历？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果是陈的剑，大概更适合对付这些家伙......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞎想什么......当务之急是要想办法尽快脱身，把真的数据带出去。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我来帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该还留在这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚把大小齐送出去，听到这边有打斗声——果然又是这伙人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队伍里的信使和守军也没事——孟铁衣把他们软禁了起来，但没伤害他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么看着我，我没说原谅你了。收拾完这帮人，我还是会找你算账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就想办法至少先活下来，这帮人可不好对付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你提醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遥夜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姓孟的你不许这么叫我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你已经知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走神？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你闭嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我凭什么闭嘴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，没事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我手刃了这个仇人，再来给你赔礼道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你凭什么，用这种好像很解脱的语气跟我说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为没有人真的丧命，因为一切还在你的掌握之中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然一开始就要演一场信使被杀的戏，何必答应我让大小齐加入队伍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿别人的性命做局，枉城里那么多兄弟拿你当最德高望重的前辈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我不是没有动摇过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你兴冲冲地找上门，说要开玉门第一家现代物流公司，一边拍着胸脯大讲规划，一边让我不用看你爹郑清钺的面子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少让人怀念年轻的岁月！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身前每一刀的力道都越来越重，身后女孩也骂得越来越激烈。\n孟铁衣不再说话，咬着牙挥锤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你说过，自己好歹曾经也是玉门城里响当当的人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"年轻的时候跟着宗师练武杀敌，快意恩仇，为了替被劫掠的百姓讨回公道，在大漠里追出去一百多里端掉流寇的窝点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玉门有多少条街、多少间铺子、多少个营帐，城里参军的兄弟来自大炎哪些地方，你都心里有数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在呢，现在的玉门，你真的关心过吗？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你比我那个守着走镖的老规矩不肯松手的爹，还要迂腐，还要糊涂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"时代是会变的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"镖局要变成物流公司，铸剑坊要变成铁匠铺，没人能拦得住，也不应该拦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你再恨、你再怨，也没资格因为现在的玉门不是当年的玉门，就要引一场天灾来考验它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你凭什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你对得起这座城市吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姓孟的，你对得起，你自己吗？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜遥夜，当心——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孟铁衣一直没有回头。\n高手之间的对决，容不下一丝一毫的分心，更何况对手是这个神秘莫测的女人。\n他也不确定自己有没有听清楚杜遥夜那个小辈骂的是什么，只觉得很大声，夹杂着很多情绪。\n但他偏偏又听清了林雨霞的那句示警，而且下意识地回了头。\n孟铁衣将手中的铁锤扔了出去，击飞了靠近杜遥夜身后的敌人。\n狭长的刀锋同时划开他的脊背。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟叔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行裕物流是个好主意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":"avg_npc_789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总不能，看着好苗子折在我眼前......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"你有没有想过，你口中的江湖还在，只是变了个样子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，到你们了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"女人跨过了地上的那具尸体。\n血顺着长刀滴落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然护送信使的任务是个局，那行裕物流等于还没有真正开张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道如果我委托行裕物流送件东西，杜小姐愿不愿意接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个时候？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个匣子里是真正的天灾数据，务必交给平祟侯。你拿着我的令牌，他会相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后祈祷一切都还来得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少来这套，让我逃走，你自己留下来逞英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该清楚，我没那么好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但总要有一个人把数据送出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个女人的武功深不可测，连孟铁衣也死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凭我的源石技艺，或许能拖住他们，为你创造几秒钟的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开什么玩笑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是觉得自己有办法拖住他们，咱们俩换也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿你朋友的事骗你，对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骗我的不止你一个，刚刚骂孟铁衣的时候，已经顺带骂了你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，忘了告诉你。其实我觉得，一个人来这么远的地方打拼事业，很了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别扯这些没用的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你记住，你要是逃不出去，玉门城也逃不过这场天灾了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是个大单子，行裕物流接了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭上眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞抖手，玻璃碎片掉落在地的瞬间化为流沙。\n角落里，天花板上，细碎的沙粒像是群溪汇流，飞快地聚拢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙尘扬起。\n狭窄的仓库内，卷起了一场沙暴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边是不是有什么东西烧起来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人纵火？过去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那沙渠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有谁会来这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"城头报时的军笛响过一轮，天色已暗，云层间隐约已经能看到圆月的轮廓。\n老刀匠如果办完事情，回到铸剑坊发现她不在，应该能想到来沙渠找自己。\n移动城市的基座咬开地面，高速运转的轮机将过大的障碍物嚼碎，混着成吨的沙砾一并吐出，声响震耳欲聋。\n老刀匠说得没错，这里没什么军士看守，因为不会有人想以这种方式出城。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（约定的时间马上就到了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"长相凶狠的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（凶狠的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三番两次被你逃脱，你倒好，自己又走到死路上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不认识你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你背上的剑，与我们的计划无关，但藏有岁兽十二分之一意识的物件，有人很感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岁兽？你说什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起来一无所知。那就更不配拿着这把剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"脑后的黑色光环......你是阿纳萨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个阿纳萨，居然和炎国移动城市里的人打成一片，可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了自己的出身？忘了你族人的遭遇？在荒野上吃苦受难，为了温饱四处流浪的时候，炎国几时帮过你们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿纳萨，你应该加入山海众。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截云 (A)","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只看到，你们在城市里到处干坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众头目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......愚不可及的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（沙尘马上就要散了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（连魏长官和爸联手都赢不了的敌人，我不可能是她的对手。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但至少要再拖她一会，给杜遥夜争取更多脱身的时间......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在害怕我，却把逃生的机会留给别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少年来，你们好像从来没有变过。把英勇赴死当成一种荣誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没那么高尚，也没打算就这样死在你手里。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一声脆响，下一秒，黄沙已经在女人面前重新凝聚成玻璃剑刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抢攻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们似乎很喜欢玩这种小把戏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽略力量悬殊的抢攻，只是找死。\n到头来，用了那么多“手段”，逼出一个孟铁衣，拿到了天灾数据。\n自己应该能算是......做了件好事？\n算吧。\n玻璃剑刃一寸寸崩坏，长刀已经落在她的眉心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赤霄，振气——"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"红色的剑气撕开了沙尘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"刀剑相击，空气被摩擦出锐响，林雨霞的剑在沙粒与玻璃间来回切换，无数浮空的透明碎片折射出一个人的身影。\n她站在自己的身前，挺拔得像是一棵胡杨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道我会来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大老远就看见你的源石技艺，我以为是在向我求救来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少自作多情，我可从没听说你会来玉门——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么会来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碰巧路过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又像多索雷斯那次一样尾随我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那次难道不是你尾随我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实是听说魏长官遭遇了刺杀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空啰嗦，不如先给我解释解释，这里到底什么情况？"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙尘终于完全散去，仓库中已空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没空解释了，去城门口！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"杜遥夜来到玉门已经有段时间了，她从没觉得玉门的街道有这么长。\n这几百米的平路，仿佛比寻日峰的山道还要难走。怀里抱着的小匣子，比挑山人担子上的山石还要重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g5_swordcastingworkshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孟铁衣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"镖局也好，物流也好，万变不离其宗，赌上的是人命，为的也是人命。想要打出这行的招牌，就得知道肩上的分量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"爹以前不厌其烦讲的那些护镖的故事，自己其实都记得。\n都是一样的道理，偏偏经历了才懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快一点，快一点......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（已经能看到城门了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人已经追上来了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"听风辨器的本领，杜遥夜学过。心无旁骛的话，这一箭她肯定能躲掉。\n箭矢贯穿了她的右肩，匣子从怀里滑出来，她赶忙伸出左手去接，结果连人带物摔倒在地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灭口，拿东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是追着另一拨坏人过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚铸剑坊，我赶到的时候看到你被官兵带走了......你现在......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再提了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我一把，先解决掉这些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放箭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放肆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"匹练，雪，或者是剑光。\n整齐断成两截的箭矢落了一地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......昨晚救左乐的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我。我有很重要的东西要交给平祟侯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯在外城城楼镇守。你的箭伤很重，还跑得动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先救货，再救人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，这里交给我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你们的林特使一个人在仓库对付那个坏女人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去帮她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。你先走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三番两次当街行凶，山海众未免太嚣张了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个女孩呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凶狠的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快得手的时候，被这两个家伙拦下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧追上去，把数据抢回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你过不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要拦我？那你这次可不能再躲我的刀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就是杜小姐刚刚说的坏女人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她追过来了，那雨霞姐她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总算赶上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姐......这位是，陈警司？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的你没看错。杜遥夜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。那就只剩下一件事可做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住这个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是无聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少年来，你们好像从来没有变过，从来不懂得敬畏力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一群蝼蚁凑在一起，还是蝼蚁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风吹散了云，月光照在空旷的长街上。\n街面很干净，除了几片枯黄的落叶贴着石砖打着旋儿。\n那是一种，繁华落尽后的干净。\n好一个萧瑟秋夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海众首领 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到此为止吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"秋夜......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最近玉门城里风波不断，都是这个人主使的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让她兴风作浪了这些天，也该到此为止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都小心点，她的源石技艺，很古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸和魏长官联手都没有留住她，这个人不知道还有多少歪门邪道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，这个满嘴胡话的女人，就是刺杀魏彦吾的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"笑话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正好在这里解决了她，回去可以好好嘲笑魏彦吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在这里了结吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
